    "description_html": "<p>Custom clear gloss labels are printed on transparent film with a high-shine glossy finish and supplied on a roll for fast, consistent application. The clear material lets your design sit on the product with no visible background, for a clean, no-label look on bottles, jars, and packaging.</p>\n<h2>Material and finish</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Transparent film with a glossy, high-shine surface</li>\n<li>Full-color digital printing with glossy ink</li>\n<li>Matte lamination available for a fully matte finish</li>\n<li>Custom size and shape, up to 7.48 inches</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Durability</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Water-resistant, tear-resistant, and UV-resistant</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Best for</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Food and beverage brands labeling bottles, jars, and containers</li>\n<li>Cosmetic and skincare products that want a clear, premium look</li>\n<li>Small businesses wanting seamless, no-background branding</li>\n<li>Packaging where the product should show through</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Ordering</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No minimum order, no setup fees, and no artwork fees</li>\n<li>Free digital proof before printing</li>\n<li>Most orders printed and delivered within 7 days, with expedited options</li>\n<li>Free shipping on orders over $75</li>\n<li>Text smaller than 2mm may be darkened slightly for legibility</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"%%GLOBAL_ShopPathSSL%%/stickers/labels-on-rolls/\">See all Labels on Rolls</a></p>"
  },
